# ─── SECRETS — never commit. Read from env vars in CI instead. ───
# GEMINI_API_KEY (comma-separated), GEMINI_MODEL, NEPSE_EMAIL / NEPSE_PASSWORD,
# BLOG_JWT are all supported as environment variables by the scripts, so none of
# these files need to exist in the repo.
.jwt
.gemini-key
.gemini-keys
.gemini-model
.gcv-key
.openrouter-key
.openrouter-model
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*

# ─── Run state — machine-local, not source ───
# Dedupe history. The backend slug lookup in auto-post-announcements.js is the
# real dedupe; this file is a local second layer restored from actions/cache in
# CI, so it must not live in git history.
.posted-source-urls.json
live-blog-state.json
news-announcements.json
news-onlinekhabar.json
news-to-post.json
pending-rephrasings.json
imported-rephrasings.json
last-gemini-failure.txt
logs/

# ─── Build / vendored ───
node_modules/

# ─── Large OCR model data (Tesseract legacy path — pipeline uses Gemini) ───
*.traineddata

# ─── Scratch output from OCR experiments ───
ocr-*.html
ocr-*.txt
